/-!
# Kernel-checked binary Parrott relations

All matrix products below are checked by Lean's kernel on literal packed
rows. The generic decoding theorem converts each check into ordinary matrix
multiplication over ZMod 2. The final theorem verifies precisely the 37
relators of Parrott (1972), p.683, and gives a nonzero off-diagonal entry.
Comparison with the actual Ree root words remains a separate obligation.
-/

